{"id": "x0056", "pool": "easy-fact", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Jeff Keegan was the leader of the youth club in the popular British TV show \" Byker Grove.\" The show aired from 1 9 88 to 20 1 5, and it followed the lives of young people living in a housing estate called By ker Grove. As the head of the youth club, he played a central role in many episodes throughout the series' long run.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 22, "carrier_ended": null}
